{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Select",
            "id": "installed_version_select",
            "props": {
              "param": "installed_version",
              "default": "",
              "valueField": "value",
              "labelField": "label",
              "label": "Installed plugin version"
            },
            "data": {
              "dataset": "versions"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpi",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Required version",
                  "field": "required_version"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Functions",
                  "field": "functions",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Call sites",
                  "field": "callsites",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files",
                  "field": "affected_files",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Unresolved",
                  "field": "unresolved",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Version check",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": true,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search file, object or function…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "severity",
                  "label": "Severity"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "script_name",
                  "label": "Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "function_name",
                  "label": "Plug-in function"
                },
                {
                  "field": "since_version",
                  "label": "Needs"
                },
                {
                  "field": "installed_version",
                  "label": "Installed"
                },
                {
                  "field": "via_custom_function",
                  "label": "Via custom function"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{object_type}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No check active — pick an installed plugin version in the header to validate the requirement (neutral entry = inventory only)."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "by_file_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Requirement per file",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "by_file"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "by_file_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "file_name",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "pageParam": "files_page",
              "searchParam": "files_q",
              "sortParam": "files_sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "required_version",
                  "label": "Required version"
                },
                {
                  "field": "top_driver",
                  "label": "Top driver"
                },
                {
                  "field": "functions",
                  "label": "Functions",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "callsites",
                  "label": "Call sites",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "unresolved",
                  "label": "Unresolved",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "drivers_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Driver functions",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "drivers"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "drivers_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "function_name",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": true,
              "pageParam": "drivers_page",
              "searchParam": "drivers_q",
              "sortParam": "drivers_sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search function or component…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "function_name",
                  "label": "Plug-in function"
                },
                {
                  "field": "component",
                  "label": "Component",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "since_version",
                  "label": "Since"
                },
                {
                  "field": "status",
                  "label": "Status"
                },
                {
                  "field": "exceeds_installed",
                  "label": "Exceeds installed"
                },
                {
                  "field": "callsites",
                  "label": "Call sites",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "PluginFunction"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "markdown",
            "props": {
              "content": "## Notes\n\nThe **required version** is a derivation: the maximum documented introduction version (`since_version`) over the plug-in functions this scope actually calls — the *driver functions* table makes it verifiable. Version comparisons run on a numeric key, never on the version string.\n\n- **Version check**: the catalog knows no installed plugin version. Pick one in the header select to flag every call to a function introduced later; the neutral entry runs no check. Installed fleets are often heterogeneous — validate divergent workstation versions one by one.\n- **Requirement per file**: the per-file spread shows which modules carry the requirement.\n- **Navigation**: driver rows open the plug-in function detail (where-used); finding rows open the calling object.\n- **Maintenance axis**: deprecated/removed calls are separate rules under *Static Code Analysis*."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
